<section class="page-hero wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Meet the founder</p><h1>Alyssa Clark.<br>The person behind the plan.</h1><p class="lede">Elite Clean Pro is a Calgary cleaning business focused on residential cleaning and move-out enquiries. I’m Alyssa, and I’m building it around clearer expectations from the start.</p></section><section class="section wrap split"><div class="founder founder-profile" style="display:block"><img class="founder-photo" src="/assets/img/alyssa-clark-founder.jpg" alt="Alyssa Clark, founder of Elite Clean Pro" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy"><p style="margin-top:30px">A real name behind every conversation.</p><p>hello@elitecleanpro.ca</p></div><div class="prose"><h2>What I want to make simpler.</h2><p>My background includes 4+ years in property management technology. I’m applying that experience to how Elite Clean Pro organises enquiries, scopes and customer communication.</p><p>It should be easy to understand what a clean includes, how a quote works and whether a date is actually confirmed. Those are the basics I want Elite Clean Pro to get right.</p><p>We’re building relationships with experienced cleaners. The goal is a practical connection between your request, the agreed work and the person who carries it out.</p><p>My focus is a practical service: clear questions at the start, an agreed scope and a straightforward contact when you need one.</p><a class="text-link" href="/book/">Tell me what you need ↗</a></div></section><section class="closing wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your next step</p><h2>A clear plan for your next clean.</h2><p>Tell us about your space. We’ll review the scope, timing and cleaner availability before confirming your appointment.</p></div><a class="button light" href="/book/">Request a quote <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
